  Maintained independently of the upstream project. Version numbering was
  restarted at 1.0.0 and does not correspond to upstream MiroTalk versions.

Modifications from upstream (as of v1.0.0)
------------------------------------------
  - Removed video, screen sharing, whiteboard, file sharing, recording and
    the related meeting features; the product is scoped to audio-only,
    persistent voice channels.
  - Rewrote the entire frontend (vanilla HTML/CSS/ES modules, no build step).
  - Added a persistent channel registry (app/src/channels.json) with an admin
    web console (/admin), per-channel moderator accounts, channel passwords,
    member caps and public/hidden visibility.
  - Added text chat over WebRTC DataChannel, with optional server-side history
    retention (app/src/chat_history) configurable at runtime.
  - Added ephemeral rooms with per-IP quotas, per-member volume control,
    audio device settings, notification sounds, dark/light theme, and a
    build-fingerprint update notifier.
  - Replaced the upstream Docker image name (mirotalk/p2p) with
    b1at/voice-channels.

